OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will be a
OL,6,Fmostly cloudy evening with further
OL,7,Fshowers which will continue to move in
OL,8,Ffrom the west overnight. Some clear
OL,9,Fspells developing later.
OL,10,
OL,11,CSaturday:FA mixture of bright
OL,12,Fintervals and scattered showers. Best
OL,13,Fof the sunny spells across Inverness
OL,14,Fand Speyside.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FRather
OL,17,Fcloudy with more scattered showers on
OL,18,FSunday. A dry start to Monday then
OL,19,Frain spreading east. Showers or longer
OL,20,Fspells of rain on Tuesday.
